  "title": "Duane NDE 22433",
  "date": "April 1991",
  "content": "I underwent a seven hour operation in a heart and lung hospital. After I was taken in to the operating theatre, my brother arrived at the hospital and was told I was in surgery. He left the hospital without seeing me and before the operation finished. A couple of days later I told him that I had seen him during the operation. He laughed and said that I couldn't have. He then asked me what he was doing, ND I then proceeded to describe what I had seen. I described his exact clothing, and the exact place that he was standing in and I also told him what he had under his arm and what he was doing. I think that it troubled him because his eyes welled up and he has never spoken to me about it since, he did confirm that I was one hundred percent correct on all points. A couple of days later I was informed by a surgeon of what had happened to me during the operation.",
